meta {
  name: Get Aircraft Model By ID
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/aircraft-models/:id
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  id: {{aircraftModelId}}
}

vars:pre-request {
  aircraftModelId: k2aBhGrDS1XxUNrZUAnBtn5RFxxBiaJD
}

docs {
  # Get Aircraft Model By ID
  
  Obtiene un modelo de aeronave por su ID (acepta ID ofuscado).
  Este endpoint es público, no requiere autenticación.
  
  ## Respuesta exitosa (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "code": "MOD_ACM_GET_EXI_00001",
    "message": "...",
    "data": {
      "id": "encoded-id",
      "model_name": "Airbus A320neo",
      "aircraft_type_name": "Narrow Body",
      "engine_type_name": "Turbofan",
      "status": true,
      "_links": [...]
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errores
  - 400: ID inválido (MOD_ACM_VAL_ERR_00001)
  - 404: Modelo no encontrado (MOD_ACM_GET_ERR_00001)
  - 500: Error interno (MOD_ACM_GET_ERR_00002)
}
